  "description": {
   "en": "Will she become the favorite of the strong-willed student council members?!\n\nMio Sakuraba has been shy since she was little. She is enthusiastic about changing herself in high school, but is forcibly recruited to join the student council by the student council president, Haru Oujou, who is also known as the \"King\"!?\n\n(Source: Shueisha, translated)",
   "ja": "キャラ強な生徒会メンバーたちのお気に入りに…!?　小さい頃から引っ込み思案な性格の桜葉澪。「高校では自分を変えたい！」と意気込むけれど〈キング〉と呼ばれる生徒会長・王城晴に強引に生徒会に勧誘されて!?"
  },
